  unitName: Water Spirit
  unitId: 20131
  unitNumber: 178
  description: A spirit that rules water, one of the six elements made by the gods.
    It hates polluters of ocean and will pretend to be a child to trick and pull
    in humans resting near the sea. However, it is naturally docile, and lore says
    it gives healing water to weary travelers. It is also said to bestow a great
    power to anyone willing to receive it.
  summonDesc: I will go with you.<br>I made up my mind.<br>Let us journey.
